#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:0
msgid ""
"Change the pointer speed of your mouse or touchpad in Ubuntu Desktop if the "
"pointer moves too fast or too slowly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:7
msgid "Topics: Accessibility Customization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:11
msgid "Adjust the speed of the mouse and touchpad"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:13
msgid ""
"If your pointer moves too fast or slow when you move your mouse or use your "
"touchpad, you can adjust the pointer speed for these devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:15
msgid "Open the Activities overview and start typing **mouse & touchpad**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:16
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Mouse & Touchpad` to open the panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:17
msgid ""
"Adjust the {guilabel}`Pointer Speed` slider until the pointer motion is "
"comfortable for you. Sometimes the most comfortable settings for one type of "
"device are not the best for the other."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/adjust-the-speed-of-the-mouse-and-touchpad.md:20
msgid ""
"The {guilabel}`Touchpad` section only appears if your system has a touchpad, "
"while the {guilabel}`Mouse` section is only visible when a mouse is "
"connected."
msgstr ""
